      "link": null,
      "locked": true,
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 3,
      "text": "1. Users should be able to start, pause, stop, and save their runs and rides.\n2. While running or cycling, users should be able to view that activity's data, including route,\ndistance, and time.\n3. Users should be able to view details about their own completed activities as well as\nthe activities of their friends.",
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "1. Users should be able to start, pause, stop, and save their runs and rides.\n2. While running or cycling, users should be able to view that activity's data, including route,\ndistance, and time.\n3. Users should be able to view details about their own completed activities as well as\nthe activities of their friends.",
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "baseline": 119
    },
