      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 3,
      "text": "- Low Latency <100ms for API requests\n- High scalability for writes (during rides/runs)\n- Availability > Consistency\n- Working Run Data in no-network areas like mountains to show run info\n- Up to date local device data for activities like current run (<5s)\n",
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "- Low Latency <100ms for API requests\n- High scalability for writes (during rides/runs)\n- Availability > Consistency\n- Working Run Data in no-network areas like mountains to show run info\n- Up to date local device data for activities like current run (<5s)\n",
